<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Open&nbsp;Elevator&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;Elevator&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><br />
SCP-XXX is a human that when held in an area against their own will (e.i. Prison, Containment Chamber, being grounded, etc),will begin to exhibit symptoms of extreme nausea. After 30 second, the subject will fall unconscious and begin to secrete blood from its mouth at a rate of approximately 100ml per second. After 5 liters, blood will stop secreting and the blood will take the form of a humanoid (designated as SCP-XXX-1) and attempt to destroy all barriers keeping SCP-XXX hostage, as well as people capable of stopping SCP-XXX's escape. Following the elimination of all potential barriers, SCP-XXX-1 will become non-anomalous as well as SCP-XXX will awake with no recollection of SCP-XXX-1's existence, or the events leading to its creation. When given information proving SCP-XXX-1's existance, it is forgotten within 5 seconds of being provided.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Open&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><br />
Prior to it disbanding, SCP-XXX was a member of the GoI Chicago Spirit. It is theorized they were non-anomalous when they joined, however due to their proximity with anomalous creature, and specificly reality bending entities interacting with his undiagnosed stage 0 chronic Leukemia may have been the cause of these properties. As a side hustle to the janitorial position the foundation offered them, SCP-XXX chooses to continue in these endeavors. After each failed heist, mugging, or other, SCP-XXX is always immediately pardoned in secret by the foundation. This causes them to pursue greater and greater crimes. This eventually causes the foundation to intervene and threaten their job security, causing them to stop. Though he began as a janitor for a foundation front company, he is now a senior janitorial staff member at Site-X after working for the foundation for X years.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> As a containment cell would be ineffective, SCP-XXX has been recruited as a full time janitor in order to keep them inside the site for as long as possible daily.
							</div>

								
