<p>Asked to take a look at this via PM.</p>
<p>Gotta agree with Zyn above; this seems less like its own flesh-out character that butts heads with containment and more a direct challenge to containment, while not being a particularly uncontainable threat. I'd also like to know about this blood creature; is it some kind of creature he contracted with?</p>
