<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Nice&nbsp;Day</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>All right, it seems we still have some misunderstandings between us.</p>
<p>In the &quot;old audio log&quot; I was having him talking to the spirit, not the foundation. In my head it makes sense for them to question their motives because well, this is organized crime, you don't come here for an extra 50 bucks.</p>
<p>At the point where he is still committing crimes, he believes the foundations front. What you said about when the crime works until it goes south, then i think it'll go like this.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Holes up in storage room<br />
Police prepare to barge in<br />
Foundation call them off<br />
Foundation bring him into the site for questioning and job security threatening. they use the story of, &quot;we pulled some string in the police department for you because we say something in you. prove to us it wasn't a mistake&quot; to convince him</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The timeline is good except for 4 and 5.<br />
For 4, the above section clarifies what needs to be changed<br />
For 5, its just the footnote, I've changed the article to say he has to recollection of the blood monster, and telling him makes him instantly forget it. Otherwise, when the foundation makes him work at an actual site, and learn they contain anomalies, he would think, &quot;wait a minute, im an anomaly. omg, this job is my containment.&quot; and containment breach.<br />
Other than that, the timeline is good</p>
